1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Welcome to the study of the simple pendulum. In this lesson we learn how mass, length and friction affect the oscillation period.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The fundamental equation is T = 2π √(L/g). Observe how changing the length changes the period proportionally to its square root.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Exercise: Find the configuration that produces an exact period of 2.0 seconds.
